From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Will Faust <willtechnoduck@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 23:56:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] iOS: Crashpad-VEH context guard + EC exception hardening
 (ml418-ml432)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- signal_arm64ec.c: #66 guard — restore pre-call CONTEXT when a
  CONTINUE_SEARCH VEH handler leaves Rip host-band/Rsp off-stack
  (Crashpad chrome_elf partial-writer neutralized); #69 support
- exception.c: VEH dispatch hardening (#66)
- sync.c + unix/sync.c: misaligned critical-section support work (#71)
- loader.c/thread.c/unix/debug.c/server/process.c: EC + pseudo-process
  hardening

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 1bebdf8aa96edd2e8217e81fe3d64e9dafc747e1)
